Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A New Journey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 30
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone standing in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You were acting so tough earlier, weren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be taking the Aqua Pearl now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to fear from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn’t even guess she’s blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re all too slow; I can see everything clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.66,0:01:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,See everything clearly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea—let’s work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s futile, no matter how many of you come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:01:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you won’t be able to see where I am either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as {\i1}she{\i0} knows where you are, that’s enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t think I don’t know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.27,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With full
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,force.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll blow this whole place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t let you get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess the ultimate power; I won’t lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t hold on much longer…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect you to be here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Use all our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the energy from these fragments that made him so powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aqua Pearl has been sitting here for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the attack just now damaged it, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This Aqua Pearl holds the water of the entire Blue Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It won’t be long before this place bursts from the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold on tight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A massive fountain has actually appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t have to worry about water anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever saves me, I’ll give them an endless supply of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, lots of water is falling from the sky…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s like…what is it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s like countless grass cakes falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a shame I can’t see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; I’ll definitely find a way to cure your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Big Sister will be able to see this beautiful world too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve brought new life back to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom will be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Drone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are so many people here, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And there’s a goat that looks just like Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely—this ragdoll looks so much like…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, it’s me, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I had a bit of an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can sleep hugging the Daddy doll every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you turn into, we’ll be waiting for you at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so good to see you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We found a fragment here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fragment I just got from Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my research, there are many more of these fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Each fragment holds immense energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If these fragments were gathered together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they would hold the power to affect the entire universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, could you use this energy to save my world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My world is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My original world…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,was beautiful and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a best friend, too—he was also named Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, a rift appeared in the sky…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…and sucked in everyone and everything—every blade of grass and tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Weslie hadn’t risked everything to get me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have been sucked in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been searching for someone who could help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you—save my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our world has those rifts too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember the night I fell into the rift,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a mysterious man draining energy from our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who used some strange method to turn me into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s a mysterious man out there draining energy from worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and a mysterious organization searching for this powerful multicolored fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They also possess the ability to cause fusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many clues; I can’t analyze them all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, this is all connected to this mysterious multicolored fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should collect these fragments first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the truth will soon come to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My sensors indicate a reading for this kind of fragment nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My drone can lead the way for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But do we have to run around carrying this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are in charge of retrieving the fragment back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie and Wolffy, you set out to find the new fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, where are we going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Mei once told me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that there are still many undiscovered secrets underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go on an adventure with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s set off.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
